  "details": "- CVE-2025-5994: do not cache non-ECS answers to ECS queries in the subnet cache (Rebirthday attack)\n- CVE-2026-40622: limit the TTL of a higher-trust NS rrset replacing a cached delegation (ghost domain)\n- CVE-2026-50106: treat an unsigned parent denial of an island trust anchor as bogus\n- CVE-2026-96405: add a per-packet budget for name decompression pointers\n- CVE-2026-109125: clear pending queries on a port when the unwanted-reply threshold is hit\n- CVE-2026-35501: fix NSEC-not-at-apex parent-side key lookup for island trust anchors",
